    "qualification": "Healing potion from a PC inventory to another visible combat participant, physical or explicit app dice, MJ confirmation. Durable atomic character receipts and resumable cost/heal progress survive lost acknowledgements, interruption, conflicts, ownership transfer and soft deletion. No global MongoDB transaction. Private participant/MJ views, stable dice replay, explicit review before changed sheets. Catalogue, character calculations, wallet/equipment/loot and previous attack/spell rules unchanged. Real MongoDB checks run separately with synthetic actors."
  },
